      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. the \"reach out\" thing. but it doesn't work. it doesn't change the fact that he's gone and i'm just... rotting in this house. it's like i'm living a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. if he could see how much i'm hurting, wouldn't he want me to just be at peace?",
